  "findings": [
    "Learning space is large: completed-crop contribution margins range from -11.5 to 64.1 EUR/m2 across 22 distinct policies.",
    "Planting season dominates: the same policy earned 44.7 (January start) and 64.1 (April start); July-started crops averaged 18.0 against 27.6 for January starts. The GP in the toolbox and in gp-bo-v1 ignores planting date, so second-wave predictions (about 46-51) far exceeded outcomes (about 10-30).",
    "Margin-so-far at day 90 is about zero for every crop (fruit harvest has barely begun) and is dominated by energy cost; the staggered Full BO chose late policies from it that did worse (28.9, -11.5) than the Endpoint space-filling choices (49.0, 64.1).",
    "All four campaigns completed within budgets (at most 21 of 32 decision calls, 24 of 128 tool calls), about 24 minutes each with four in parallel."
